{"id":1120103,"chapter_id":1120103,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"乌云笼罩了整个城市，随着一声惊雷，大雨飘然而至。地面上聚集起蜿蜒的水流，冲刷过那一片残骸，将血污与晶源液混杂在一起，流向低洼的下水道。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"你凭借枷锁的能力，分析出海拉与九十九所在的位置，而等你赶到时，看见的便是眼前这一景象——","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"封闭车倒在一边，半个车身已经成了碎片，泄露的能源散发着刺鼻的气味，海拉倒在废墟之中，浑身是伤。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"九十九拿着武器站在一边，沾满了令人不悦的气味。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"就像当年帕尔马的悲惨情景一样。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"options":["使用枷锁。"],"style":6,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103006,"trial_step":6,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"使用枷锁。","goto":7}]},{"step":7,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"不行！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"见你使用枷锁，夜莺立刻将你拦下。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"这个时候使用枷锁，无异于精神自杀！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"难道您没看出来吗？九十九的变异已经达到临界值，随时随地都会堕化成死役！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"所以呢？我就要放弃她吗？","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你们………不要过来！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我……我可以……","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"倒在一边的海拉艰难地爬起来，拦住了九十九——你肉眼可见，海拉的再生速度变得非常缓慢。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"九十九！海拉现在就在你身边！","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"你不能失去理智！","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"你朝九十九喊着，可她几乎听不进任何声音。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"这个程度已经可以当做死役看待。","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"直接进行火力压制！！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"跟随你一起前来的FAC成员，举起了枪弹，对准九十九。砰砰的枪声响起，潮湿的空气之中弥漫起了硝烟的味道。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"然而就如你所料，只要挡住致命伤，区区子弹根本无法伤到狂化的九十九分毫……","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"不行！我必须试一试！！","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"你拨开人群，直面九十九。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"options":["使用枷锁。"],"style":6,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103025,"trial_step":25,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"使用枷锁。","goto":26}]},{"step":26,"content":"呃！！！","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"崩溃的精神透过枷锁传入你的脑海，似乎将你的大脑都烧热沸腾，而九十九也因此，将目标转向了你。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"她拖曳着从废墟里抽出来的钢筋，一步步向你走来。身后如鬼魅一般的死役黑影，叫嚣着要将你拖入深渊。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"海拉","content":"九十九，停下来吧……九十九！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我不会让你过去的！我……我要再次把你救出来！！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"九十九","content":"吼————！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"content":"九十九每一次试图朝你冲过来时，海拉都会爬起来，抱着她，不让她再往前走。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"即便九十九的怒火与攻击都落在了她身上，也不肯松手。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"speaker":"九十九","content":"放……开……","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"九十九","content":"啊……！！！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你个OO的！！还不快走！！在这里干什么！！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"你们两个，我都要救下来。","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"海拉","content":"呸！！你的枷锁……根本不起作用！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我……我不疼……！在……在帕尔玛的时候，这就是我和……呃啊！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"海拉","content":"这就是我们的相处方式！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我会让她……让她……啊——！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"九十九举起钢筋，硬生生地将海拉打开。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"海拉","content":"笨蛋！！你快走啊！！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我可以的……我会让她……克制住自己的……","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"海拉的声音颤抖着，死死地牵制住九十九，你无法坐视不管，绕开所有人走向九十九。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"九十九，你真的要把海拉杀死吗？","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"你真的完全遗忘……你们所有的回忆了吗？","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"九十九","content":"……","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"九十九","content":"放……开……","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我们……吧……","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"海拉","content":"九十九！不要！！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"海拉再一次被击退，缓慢的再生让她没能及时纠缠住九十九。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"然而暴雨之中，你却突然明白九十九话中的含义，以及她眼中的期望。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"九十九","content":"救救她——","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"九十九","content":"杀了我——","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"options":["使用枷锁。"],"style":6,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103056,"trial_step":56,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"使用枷锁。","goto":57}]},{"step":57,"content":"枷锁迅速缠绕进九十九的精神中，她举起的刀还未落下，你主动迎上去，给予了她一个拥抱。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"content":"混沌的精神缠住了你，脑海中全是崩溃的尖叫回音。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"content":"而在深渊深处，你听见了九十九的声音——","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"九十九","content":"不要……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"抱歉，是我……太弱小了。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"你一定还舍不得这个世界。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"speaker":"九十九","content":"崩溃吧……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"content":"对不起，一开始的我辜负了你的期望。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"九十九","content":"好痛苦……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"content":"我要变得更强大才行。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"九十九","content":"坠落吧……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"content":"我总说要拯救你们每一个人，认为我拥有枷锁，一定可以做到。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"但我似乎低估了那些来自虚空的力量……也有些……沾沾自喜了。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"九十九","content":"没有希望了……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"content":"无论如何，我一定会把你救回来……还给海拉。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"content":"我会让枷锁……变得更加强大。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"content":"可是你要明确告诉我。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"你盼望的是死亡，还是太阳？","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"少女的声音","content":"“那……你要不要和我一起去外面看看太阳？”","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"speaker":"九十九","content":"不……不……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我……我的太阳……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我——我……我想要……活下来！！","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"content":"太好了，我也是这么想的。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"speaker":"九十九","content":"可是……我该怎么做……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我伤害了海拉，伤害了你……","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"九十九","content":"枷锁……救不了我……我……我的命运……就是……怪物。","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":"我一定会救你，你的命运不会走向毁灭与怪物！！","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"content":"但我希望你也知道，枷锁并不是为了拿捏你们的命运，给你们印上“怪物”的标签。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"content":"况且，你能反抗枷锁，就意味着……你能反抗压迫你的怪物。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"content":"九十九愣愣地看着你，你似乎听见了有什么东西正在破碎——围绕着她的深渊，正在崩塌。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"options":["释放枷锁"],"style":6,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103087,"trial_step":87,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"释放枷锁","goto":88}]},{"step":88,"content":"回来吧，九十九，你的海拉，你的太阳……在等着你。","style":2,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"九十九","content":"呃啊啊啊……好疼……好疼！！","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"content":"九十九连接着你的精神，脑海中，九十九挣扎着，到处横冲直撞。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"九十九","content":"不……我不要，不要！不会回去地狱……我不！！！","style":1,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"content":"啪嗒！","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"content":"枷锁的链接，生生断开了，白昼涌入，刺得你睁不开眼。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"content":"脑海中的尖啸声达到峰值后飘散而去，受到精神枷锁的反噬，你的耳朵和鼻子都流下了鲜血。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"嗯？九十九？","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"content":"你的肩膀上，被搭上了什么重物，让你浑身一紧。你还未能看清眼前的东西，抬起手来轻轻摸了一下——她的脖子上还带着特殊材质的项圈，随着脉搏的跳动，一点点震动着。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"content":"这让你终于松了一口气，被困的野兽冲破了牢笼，在你怀中放弃了抵抗，软软地靠在你肩膀上。","style":3,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"暴走对象……平复下来了？","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"怎么可能……？！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"content":"雨停了，九十九。","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"content":"等你醒来，我们可以一起去看太阳。","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"不可能！我亲眼看见禁闭者九十九暴走，并且无差别攻击其他人！","style":1,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"但你也亲眼看到了，我的枷锁完全控制住她了。","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"content":"包括她的狂厄暴走。","style":2,"background":100,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"content":"办公室——","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"content":"监控中，九十九依旧被关在禁闭室里，只不过不再像上次那样被全方位限制。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"距离劫车事件已经过去十天，禁闭者九十九在苏醒后，未曾有过狂化倾向，侵蚀程度也大幅度停滞。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"content":"每一天的状况都记录在案，附带脑电波磁核分析，体液温度详情记载报告。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"所有的报告和记录资料都在这里，接受FAC的一切检查与调研。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"如果还有疑问，可以直接来危机管理局进行实地考察。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"在禁闭者九十九的房间对面，我们安置了一处非常适合观察的房间……","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"够了，这件事到此为止吧，我们可以让这位禁闭者留在MBCC。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"但这并不代表我们对这位禁闭者完全信任，我们会随时进行抽查。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"如果这期间她有任何的狂化表现，我们将第一时间解决她。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"FAC调查员","content":"以及她身边那个像猴子一样的禁闭者。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"content":"放心吧，有我和海拉在，就绝不会再发生这种事。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"content":"会议结束，你与夜莺目送气冲冲的FAC调查员离开后，转身前往关押九十九与海拉的禁闭室。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，你真的能保证九十九不会再发狂吗？","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"虽然您最后将她压制住，可是我们至今没有弄清楚为何她到达临界值后，精神污染会迅速下降。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"就仿佛凭空消失了一般……","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"content":"我不能保证……但我也并不害怕。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"content":"毕竟这件事也足以证明，我的力量升级了。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103123,"trial_step":123},{"step":124,"content":"至少在九十九这个等级的精神污染，我也能够压制。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……但愿如此吧。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"speaker":"海拉","content":"对了，局长……","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"content":"夜莺翻开一份报告，语气颇为无奈地对你说到——","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103127,"trial_step":127},{"step":128,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，85%以上的工作人员认为，您不应该将九十九和海拉关在一起。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":2,"src_id":220103128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"content":"为什么？","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"她们在一起太危险了，随时随地都有可能再次出逃。","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"九十九什么也不懂，对海拉的话惟命是从……","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"content":"她们才刚经历过生离死别，补偿她们关在一起不是挺好的？","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"content":"况且……我认为海拉对抑制九十九的狂化还是很有帮助的。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"speaker":"海拉","content":"喂——九十九——你理我一下啊九十九——","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"九十九","content":"好的，我理你。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啊——不是这种理我！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"speaker":"海拉","content":"你应该跟我说！你想要玩什么吗？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103137,"trial_step":137},{"step":138,"speaker":"九十九","content":"哦，那你想要玩什么吗？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"speaker":"九十九","content":"如果可以的话，我拒绝玩把你扔上天然后接住你的游戏。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"speaker":"海拉","content":"为什么？！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"speaker":"九十九","content":"因为会把天花板砸出一个洞，局长说了，维修起来很麻烦。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103141,"trial_step":141},{"step":142,"speaker":"海拉","content":"……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103142,"trial_step":142},{"step":143,"speaker":"海拉","content":"……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103143,"trial_step":143},{"step":144,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我的天啊！！！我的九十九居然会因为那个局长拒绝我！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103144,"trial_step":144},{"step":145,"content":"嗯？有什么不对吗？","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103145,"trial_step":145},{"step":146,"speaker":"九十九","content":"局长？你怎么来了？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103146,"trial_step":146},{"step":147,"content":"我再不来，这里的天花板又要遭殃了。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103147,"trial_step":147},{"step":148,"content":"看来除了阻止你们逃跑，还得阻止你们拆家……","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103148,"trial_step":148},{"step":149,"speaker":"海拉","content":"呸，只要九十九不愿意，我才不会做什么呢！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103149,"trial_step":149},{"step":150,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我只要待在九十九身边就够了！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103150,"trial_step":150},{"step":151,"speaker":"海拉","content":"但是九十九今天居然拒绝我了……我好伤心啊！！我要和她冷战五分钟！","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103151,"trial_step":151},{"step":152,"content":"海拉说完，便跑去角落里蹲着，留下一个固执的背影给你和九十九。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103152,"trial_step":152},{"step":153,"speaker":"九十九","content":"这个时候，我是不是应该去哄哄她？","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103153,"trial_step":153},{"step":154,"content":"不用，我想她只是为了让我能和你单独说几句话。","style":2,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103154,"trial_step":154},{"step":155,"speaker":"九十九","content":"单独说的话……","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103155,"trial_step":155},{"step":156,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我记得海拉告诉过我，很重要的话，必须面对面的说出来。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103156,"trial_step":156},{"step":157,"speaker":"九十九","content":"我思考了一下，我觉得我有很重要的话，要跟局长说。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103157,"trial_step":157},{"step":158,"content":"九十九脸上带着一丝微笑，带着解脱一般的畅快感。","style":3,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103158,"trial_step":158},{"step":159,"speaker":"九十九","content":"海拉带我逃离了帕尔马……而你将我从深渊之中解救出来。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103159,"trial_step":159},{"step":160,"speaker":"九十九","content":"谢谢你，束缚住了我的野兽。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103160,"trial_step":160},{"step":161,"speaker":"九十九","content":"由此……我能得到真正的自由。","style":1,"background":1025,"log_type":1,"src_id":220103161,"trial_step":161}]}